How it works:
User opens BuilderView.tsx
formBuilderStore.ts loads form schema from API or localStorage
ComponentPalette shows draggable items from componentRegistry.ts
User drags → dnd/ system handles → updates store → Canvas re-renders
User clicks component → PropertiesPanel opens with ValidationBuilder
Auto-save triggers → storageService.ts persists to API
