apps/websocket/ - Real-Time Collaboration Server
Separate service for WebSocket connections (horizontal scaling).
plain
Copy
apps/websocket/
├── src/
│   ├── handlers/
│   │   ├── presenceHandler.ts    # "User is typing", online status
│   │   ├── cursorHandler.ts      # Live cursor positions
│   │   ├── operationHandler.ts   # Operational Transform (OT)
│   │   └── roomHandler.ts        # Join/leave form editing rooms
│   │
│   └── utils/
│       ├── operationalTransform.ts  # Conflict resolution algorithm
│       └── conflictResolver.ts      # Merge concurrent edits
│
└── server.ts                   # WebSocket entry point
Why separate?
WebSockets need long-lived connections (different from HTTP)
Can scale independently (1000s of concurrent editors)
Redis pub-sub syncs across multiple WebSocket servers
